(92, 1, '2022-09-16 07:27:29', '2022-09-16 07:27:29', '<p class=\"text-center\" style=\";color: #4f4f4f;\"><strong>For immediate bail service please call\r\n949-249-2777</strong>\r\n<a class=\"d-block mb-3\" style=\"color: #0000cc; font-weight: 600;\" title=\"blocked::mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\" href=\"mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\">info@newport-beachbailbonds.com</a></p>', 'Contact Us - Directions', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-09-16 07:27:29', '2022-09-16 07:27:29', '', 12, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=92', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(93, 1, '2022-09-16 07:27:39', '2022-09-16 07:27:39', '<p class=\"text-justify\">We are proud to serve our community in the Southern California area. While we offer a variety of bail bonds, <strong>Orange County</strong>, California is a unique community that offers us other opportunities for community service. Our bail bond services are structured to help local cities efficiently handle their inmate population. We offer private services that help police departments and legal systems maintain their inmate tracking systems and ensure proper compliance on behalf of the individuals that are subjected to trial.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">You can be assured that if you have an outstanding bail bond in Newport Beach or surrounding areas in California such as Anaheim, San Clemente, Orange County you will be equally served by our forty-five years of experience. We are privately owned and offer services that are discrete and affordable.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\" style=\"color: #990000;\"><strong>Bail Bond, Newport Beach, California</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\r\n 	<li>24 hour Emergency Bail Bond Service</li>\r\n 	<li>Convenient Bail Bonds Services</li>\r\n 	<li>Call Any Time, Day or Night</li>\r\n 	<li>All Felonies or Misdemeanors Covered</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Courts</li>\r\n 	<li>Family Owned and Operated for over 45 Years</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Jails</li>\r\n 	<li>Collateral Not Always Needed.</li>\r\n 	<li>Also Provide National Bail Bonding Service</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><strong style=\"color: #990000;\">Newport Beach services these areas:</strong> Aliso Viejo Anaheim Brea Buena Park Cypress Capistrano Beach Corona Del Mar Newport Beach Bail Bonds Coto De Caza Dana Point Foothill Ranch Fountain Valley Fullerton Garden Grove Newport Beach Newport Beach La Habra Ladera Ranch Newport Beach Newport Hills Newport Niguel Newport Woods Lake Forest La Palma Los Alamitos Midway City Mission Viejo Monarch Beach Newport Beach Orange Placentia Rancho Santa Margarita San Clemente San Juan Capistrano Santa Ana Seal Beach Stanton Sunset Beach Talega Trabuco Canyon Tustin Villa Park Westminster Yorba Linda</p>', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '10-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-09-16 07:27:39', '2022-09-16 07:27:39', '', 10, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=93', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(94, 1, '2022-09-16 07:27:41', '2022-09-16 07:27:41', '<p class=\"text-justify\">No matter where you are from; if you are arrested in Newport Beach you will need a <a class=\"orng_link\" href=\"http://www.bailall.com/orangecountybailbond.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>local bail bondsman.</strong></a> Our agents are ready to get you and yours out immediately. To locate your loved one or to find out what crimes they have been charged with, please call us at 949-249-2777 or fill out the \"Find an Inmate\" form, below.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">When you call us you will speak directly with the one of our family members who will answer all of you questions in a professional and personable manner. We will spend whatever time is necessary to answer your questions and understand your situation before making suggestions, then you will decide if posting bail is the most logical and cost effective thing to do. Please call us now for immediate bail bond service. We are looking forward to helping you.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Please view the other pages in our website to give you a better understanding of our company and the bail bond process.</p>', 'Find an Inmate', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-09-16 07:27:41', '2022-09-16 07:27:41', '', 14, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=94', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(95, 1, '2022-09-16 07:28:15', '2022-09-16 07:28:15', '<h2 class=\"sub-heading text-center mt-2\">Bail Bonds in Newport Beach</h2>\r\n<h3 class=\"own-title text-center\"><strong>Family Owned and Operated Bail Bond Service Since 1963</strong></h3>\r\n<h1 class=\"title-rate text-center pt-1 mb-3\">Lowest Rates</h1>\r\n<p class=\"text-center mb-2\">Collateral Not Always Required</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center mb-2\">Fast - Credit Available - Discreet</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 class=\"title-hour text-center mt-3\">24 HOURS</h1>\r\n<h3 class=\"own-title sm text-center\"><strong>Located only Minutes from All Jails (Se Habla Espanol)</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"text-center payment-wrap\"><a href=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/contactus.php\"><img class=\"cc_images\" src=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/wp-content/themes/beachbailbonds-child/assets/images/cc-images.jpg\" alt=\"Credit card payment accepted for bail bonds\" /></a><a href=\"http://www.la.bbb.org/business-reviews/Bail-Bonds-Service/Orange-County-Bail-Bonds-Inc-in-Santa-Ana-CA-13146500\"><img class=\"bbb_img\" src=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/wp-content/themes/beachbailbonds-child/assets/images/bbb-clickratingsm.gif\" alt=\"BBB Accredidation\" /></a></div>\r\n<div class=\"text-center m2-1\"><a style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/bail-bonds-newport-beach-newport-beach-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check out Bail Bonds Newport Beach on Yelp</a></div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><a class=\"orng_link\" href=\"http://www.bailall.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Bail Bonds Newport Beach</strong></a> is excited and proud to announce the 45th anniversary of our family helping families in Newport Beach and through out California with their bail bond needs. Starting in 1963, Bail Bonds Newport Beach has provided fast and discreet bail service for Newport Beach bail bonds. We also service your bail needs through out Orange County,<strong>Los Angeles County Bail Bonds</strong>,<strong>Riverside County Bail Bonds</strong> and <strong>San Diego County Bail Bonds</strong>. Nationwide service is available, as well. When you need a bail bond in Newport Beach; we can often offer financing and collateral is not always required. We specialize in the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Drug Offenses</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Drunk Driving</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Spousal Abuse</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Felonies</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Misdemeanors</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Courts</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Jails</li>\r\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds 24-Hour Service</li>\r\n 	<li>Bail Bonds for Local and National Service</li>\r\n 	<li>Hablamos Espanol</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">For a free in-depth bail bond consultation and an overview of our services, please don’t hesitate to call us now at <strong>949-249-2777</strong></p>\r\nOur staff members are eager to assist you.\r\nIf it involves bail bonds...it involves Orange County Bail Bonds!\r\nDiscretion assured... \"Any court, any jail, any time!\"\r\n<p class=\"orng_link\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Irvine, Santa Ana, Laguna Beach, and Huntington Beach</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\" style=\";color: #4f4f4f;\"><em style=\"color: #0000cc; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 600;\">We\'ll meet you at the jail</em>\r\n<strong>Bail Bonds Newport Beach\r\n120 Tustin Avenue Suite C1092\r\nNewport Beach, CA 92663\r\nToll Free: (800) 422-4540 | Toll Free: (888) BAIL-ALL\r\nTel: (949) 249-2777 </strong>\r\n<a class=\"d-block mb-3\" style=\"color: #0000cc; font-weight: 600;\" title=\"blocked::mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\" href=\"mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\">info@newport-beachbailbonds.com</a>\r\n<span class=\"\">*Conditions Apply</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-09-16 07:28:15', '2022-09-16 07:28:15', '', 5, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=95', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
