(111, 1, '2023-07-21 07:06:49', '2023-07-21 07:06:49', '<p class=\"text-justify\">No matter where you are from; if you are arrested in Newport Beach you will need a <a class=\"orng_link\" href=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>local bail bondsman.</strong></a> Our agents are ready to get you and yours out immediately. To locate your loved one or to find out what crimes they have been charged with, please call us at 949-249-2777 or fill out the \"Find an Inmate\" form, below.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">When you call us you will speak directly with the one of our family members who will answer all of you questions in a professional and personable manner. We will spend whatever time is necessary to answer your questions and understand your situation before making suggestions, then you will decide if posting bail is the most logical and cost effective thing to do. Please call us now for immediate bail bond service. We are looking forward to helping you.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Please view the other pages in our website to give you a better understanding of our company and the bail bond process.</p>', 'Find an Inmate', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-07-21 07:06:49', '2023-07-21 07:06:49', '', 14, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=111', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(113, 1, '2024-10-07 10:10:49', '2024-10-07 10:10:49', 'Anaheim Bail Bonds\r\nCall Anaheim Bail Bonds\r\n\r\nOur main office, located across the street from the Orange County jail facility, is a family owned and operated Anaheim bail bond service, and has been helping the community since 1963. We have an agent in Anaheim; ready to serve you, immediately.  For bail bonds, Irvine residents trust our local service, as we are just minutes from all jails in the area. For immediate service with bail, Huntington Beach residents call toll free 800-422-4540. We operate at the lowest rates, and collateral is not always necessary for a bail bond. Newport Beach, Mission Viejo, and Anaheim are just a few of the county\'s cities we proudly serve. For more information on our services, please browse our articles, or contact us today for quick service from our family to yours.\r\n\r\n\r\n 	\r\nAnaheim Bail Bonds\r\nFamily Owned and Operated Bail Bond Service since 1963\r\nLowest Rates\r\nCollateral Not Always Required\r\nFast – Credit Available – Discreet\r\n24 HOURS\r\nLocated only Minutes from All Jails (Se Habla Espanol)\r\nCredit card payment accepted for bail bonds BBB Accredidation\r\n\r\nOrange County Bail Bonds is excited and proud to announce the 45th anniversary of our family helping families in Anaheim and through out California with their bail bond needs. Starting in 1963, Orange County Bail Bonds has provided fast and discreet bail service for Anaheim bail bonds. We also service your bail needs through out Orange County, Los Angeles County Bail Bonds, Riverside County Bail Bonds and San Diego County Bail Bonds. Nationwide service is available, as well. When you need a bail bond in Anaheim; we can often offer financing and collateral is not always required. We specialize in the following areas:\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for Drug Offenses\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for Drunk Driving\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for Spousal Abuse\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for All Felonies\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for All Misdemeanors\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for All Courts\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds for All Jails\r\n•	Anaheim bail bonds 24-Hour Service\r\n•	Bail Bonds for Local and National Service\r\n•	Hablamos Espanol\r\nFor a free in-depth bail bond consultation and an overview of our services, please don’t hesitate to call us now at 714-772-2045\r\nOur staff members are eager to assist you.\r\nIf it involves bail bonds…it involves Orange County Bail Bonds!\r\nDiscretion assured… “Any court, any jail, any time!”\r\nNewport Beach, Santa Ana, Laguna Beach, and Huntington Beach\r\nWe’ll meet you at the jail\r\n200 S. Anaheim Blvd.\r\nAnaheim, CA 92805\r\nToll Free: (800) 422-4540 | Toll Free: (888) BAIL-ALL\r\nTel: (714) 772-2045\r\ninfo@anaheimbail-bonds.com\r\n*Conditions Apply', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-07 10:10:49', '2024-10-07 10:10:49', '', 5, 'http://localhost/anaheimbail/?p=113', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(114, 1, '2024-10-07 10:11:50', '2024-10-07 10:11:50', '<h2 class=\"sub-heading text-center mt-2\">Bail Bonds in Newport Beach</h2>\n<h3 class=\"own-title text-center\"><strong>Family Owned and Operated Bail Bond Service Since 1963</strong></h3>\n<h1 class=\"title-rate text-center pt-1 mb-3\">Lowest Rates</h1>\n<p class=\"text-center mb-2\">Collateral Not Always Required</p>\n<p class=\"text-center mb-2\">Fast - Credit Available - Discreet</p>\n\n<h1 class=\"title-hour text-center mt-3\">24 HOURS</h1>\n<h3 class=\"own-title sm text-center\"><strong>Located only Minutes from All Jails (Se Habla Espanol)</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"text-center payment-wrap\"><a href=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/contactus.php\"><img class=\"cc_images\" src=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/wp-content/themes/beachbailbonds/assets/images/cc-images.jpg\" alt=\"Credit card payment accepted for bail bonds\" /></a><a href=\"http://www.la.bbb.org/business-reviews/Bail-Bonds-Service/Orange-County-Bail-Bonds-Inc-in-Santa-Ana-CA-13146500\"><img class=\"bbb_img\" src=\"https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/wp-content/themes/beachbailbonds/assets/images/bbb-clickratingsm.gif\" alt=\"BBB Accredidation\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"text-center m2-1\"><a style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/bail-bonds-newport-beach-newport-beach-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check out Bail Bonds Newport Beach on Yelp</a></div>\n<div class=\"mt-3\">\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Bail Bonds Newport Beach</strong> is excited and proud to announce the 45th anniversary of our family helping families in Newport Beach and through out California with their bail bond needs. Starting in 1963, Bail Bonds Newport Beach has provided fast and discreet bail service for Newport Beach bail bonds. We also service your bail needs through out <a href=\"https://www.bailall.com\"><strong>Orange County</strong></a>, <strong>Los Angeles County Bail Bonds</strong>, <strong>Riverside County Bail Bonds</strong> and <strong>San Diego County Bail Bonds</strong>. Nationwide service is available, as well. When you need a bail bond in Newport Beach; we can often offer financing and collateral is not always required. We specialize in the following areas:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Drug Offenses</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Drunk Driving</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for Spousal Abuse</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Felonies</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Misdemeanors</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Courts</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds for All Jails</li>\n 	<li>Newport Beach bail bonds 24-Hour Service</li>\n 	<li>Bail Bonds for Local and National Service</li>\n 	<li>Hablamos Espanol</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">For a free in-depth bail bond consultation and an overview of our services, please don’t hesitate to call us now at <strong>949-249-2777</strong></p>\nOur staff members are eager to assist you.\nIf it involves bail bonds...it involves Orange County Bail Bonds!\nDiscretion assured... \"Any court, any jail, any time!\"\n<p class=\"orng_link\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Irvine, Santa Ana, Laguna Beach, and <a href=\"http://www.huntingtonbeachbail-bonds.com/\">Huntington Beach</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"text-center\" style=\";color: #4f4f4f;\"><em style=\"color: #0000cc; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 600;\">We\'ll meet you at the jail</em>\n<strong>Bail Bonds Newport Beach\n120 Tustin Avenue Suite C1092\nNewport Beach, CA 92663\nToll Free: (800) 422-4540 | Toll Free: (888) BAIL-ALL\nTel: (949) 249-2777 </strong>\n<a class=\"d-block mb-3\" style=\"color: #0000cc; font-weight: 600;\" title=\"blocked::mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\" href=\"mailto:info@newport-beachbailbonds.com\">info@newport-beachbailbonds.com</a>\n<span class=\"\">*Conditions Apply</span></p>\n\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-07 10:11:50', '2024-10-07 10:11:50', '', 5, 'http://localhost/anaheimbail/?p=114', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
